OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain for the
OL,6,Fevening, turning more persistent late
OL,7,Fevening and during the early hours of
OL,8,FFriday morning. Rain turning light and
OL,9,Fpatchy later. Southwest winds easing
OL,10,Flight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FRather cloudy morning with
OL,13,Fsome early patchy rain, mainly
OL,14,Fconfined across Borders. Clearing to
OL,15,Fbrighter spells and scattered showers
OL,16,Ffrom mid-day, with many in the east
OL,17,Fstaying dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
