OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday brings showers, with east
OL,7,Fmost sheltered. Sunday starts wet and
OL,8,Fwindy, before clearing to blustery
OL,9,Fshowers for afternoon. Monday mainly
OL,10,Fdry with brighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
